msgstr "ການຢືນຢັນລົ້ມເຫຼວ"

#: ../DistUpgrade/DistUpgradeFetcherCore.py:274
#: ../UpdateManager/Core/DistUpgradeFetcherCore.py:274
msgid ""
"Authenticating the upgrade failed. There may be a problem with the network "
"or with the server. "
msgstr ""
"ການຢືນຢັນຂໍ້ມູນການອັບເກຣດລົ້ມເຫຼວ. ອາດຈະເປັນບັນຫາຂອງເຄືອຂ່າຍ ຫຼື ເຊີບເວີ. "

#: ../DistUpgrade/DistUpgradeFetcherCore.py:279
#: ../UpdateManager/Core/DistUpgradeFetcherCore.py:279
msgid "Failed to extract"
msgstr "ການດຶງຂໍ້ມູນລົ້ມເຫລວ"

#: ../DistUpgrade/DistUpgradeFetcherCore.py:280
#: ../UpdateManager/Core/DistUpgradeFetcherCore.py:280
msgid ""
"Extracting the upgrade failed. There may be a problem with the network or "
"with the server. "
msgstr "ການດຶງຂໍ້ມູນການອັບເກຣດລົ້ມເຫລວ. ອາດເປັນບັນຫາຂອງເຄືອຂ່າຍ ຫຼື ເຊີບເວີ. "

#: ../DistUpgrade/DistUpgradeFetcherCore.py:285
#: ../UpdateManager/Core/DistUpgradeFetcherCore.py:285
msgid "Verification failed"
msgstr "ການກວດສອບລົ້ມເຫລວ"

#: ../DistUpgrade/DistUpgradeFetcherCore.py:286
#: ../UpdateManager/Core/DistUpgradeFetcherCore.py:286
msgid ""
"Verifying the upgrade failed.  There may be a problem with the network or "
"with the server. "
msgstr "ການກວດສອບໂປຣແກຣມອັບເກຣດລົ້ມເຫລວ. ອາດເປັນບັນຫາຂອງເຄືອຂ່າຍ ຫຼື ເຊີບເວີ. "

#: ../DistUpgrade/DistUpgradeFetcherCore.py:300
#: ../DistUpgrade/DistUpgradeFetcherCore.py:306
#: ../UpdateManager/Core/DistUpgradeFetcherCore.py:300
#: ../UpdateManager/Core/DistUpgradeFetcherCore.py:306
msgid "Can not run the upgrade"
msgstr "ບໍ່ສາມາດດຳເນີນການອັບເກຣດໄດ້"

#: ../DistUpgrade/DistUpgradeFetcherCore.py:301
#: ../UpdateManager/Core/DistUpgradeFetcherCore.py:301
msgid ""
"This usually is caused by a system where /tmp is mounted noexec. Please "
"remount without noexec and run the upgrade again."
msgstr ""
"ສາເຫດທີ່ເປັນໄປໄດ້ແມ່ນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ /tmp ຂອງລະບົບບໍ່ມີສິດໃນການດຳເນີນການ. "
"ກະລຸນາເມົາທ໌ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີນີ້ຄືນໃໝ່ດ້ວຍສິດດຳເນີນການ ແລ້ວອັບເກຣດໃໝ່."

#: ../DistUpgrade/DistUpgradeFetcherCore.py:307
#: ../UpdateManager/Core/DistUpgradeFetcherCore.py:307
#, python-format
msgid "The error message is '%s'."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຄວາມຜິດພາດແມ່ນ \"%s\"."

#: ../DistUpgrade/DistUpgradeViewText.py:93
msgid ""
"Please report this as a bug and include the files /var/log/dist-upgrade/main."
"log and /var/log/dist-upgrade/apt.log in your report. The upgrade has "
"aborted.\n"
"Your original sources.list was saved in /etc/apt/sources.list.distUpgrade."
msgstr ""
"ກະລຸນາລາຍງານຂໍ້ຜິດພາດນີ້ ແລະ ລວມໄຟລ໌ /var/log/dist-upgrade/main.log ແລະ /var/"
"log/dist-upgrade/apt.log ໃນລາຍງານ. ການອັບເກຣດຖືກຍົກເລີກແລ້ວ.\n"
"ໄຟລ໌ sources.list ຕົ້ນສະບັບຂອງທ່ານຖືກບັນທຶກໄວ້ທີ່ /etc/apt/sources.list."
"distUpgrade."

#: ../DistUpgrade/DistUpgradeViewText.py:117
msgid "Aborting"
msgstr "ຢຸດ"

